No uv.lock exists for branch PY-013, and none can.

`uv lock` refuses before it reaches resolution:

    error: Failed to inspect Python interpreter from provided path
      Caused by: Python 3.6.15 is not supported. Please use Python 3.8
      or newer.

This file is committed in place of the lockfile so that its absence is
explicit rather than looking like an oversight. dataset.json records
the same fact machine-readably as branchFunctional: false.
